### Attribution Platform — Auth endpoints
### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### Register a new user
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Get current user (protected) — uses token from the login response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### --- Negative cases ---

### Register with short password (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bad",
  "email": "bad@test.com",
  "password": "short"
}

### Login with wrong password (expect 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Access /me without token (expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### --- Facebook OAuth / Workspace ---

### Get FB OAuth connect URL (protected) — open the returned url in a browser
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/facebook/connect
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### FB connection status (protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workspace/fb-status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### List ad accounts (protected; requires FB connected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workspace/ad-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Select an ad account (protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workspace/select-ad-account
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "adAccountId": "act_123456789"
}

### --- Sync ---

### Trigger a manual sync (protected; requires FB connected + ad account)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/trigger
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "datePreset": "last_30d"
}

### Sync status (protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### --- AmoCRM ---

### Get AmoCRM OAuth connect URL (protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/amocrm/connect
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### AmoCRM status (protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workspace/amocrm-status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### List AmoCRM pipelines (protected; requires connected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workspace/amocrm-pipelines
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Save pipeline + won stage (protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workspace/amocrm-pipeline
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pipelineId": "7486112",
  "wonStageId": "142"
}

### Simulate AmoCRM webhook (form-urlencoded) — replace secret + subdomain
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/amocrm?secret=dev_amocrm_webhook_secret_change_me
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

account[subdomain]=example&leads[status][0][id]=100&leads[status][0][status_id]=142&leads[status][0][price]=5000

### --- Attribution ---

### Reprocess attribution for a lead (protected). Optional body: {"model":"linear"}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/attribution/reprocess/LEAD_UUID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "time_decay"
}

### --- Pixel Tracking (public, CORS *) ---

### Get the pixel script (replace workspaceId)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pixel/script.js?workspaceId=WORKSPACE_ID

### 1x1 tracking gif
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pixel/1x1.gif?workspaceId=WORKSPACE_ID

### Track an event (always returns 200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pixel/event
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workspaceId": "WORKSPACE_ID",
  "eventType": "purchase",
  "fbclid": "abc123",
  "email": "buyer@example.com",
  "phone": "+998901234567",
  "value": 99.0,
  "currency": "USD"
}
